    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Clinique Vétérinaire Tison, on boulevard Pasteur in Cavalaire-sur-Mer, is an option in town for your dog's care, alongside <a href="/en/fiche-veterinaire-jackowski">Clinique Vétérinaire du Dr Jackowski</a>, with a full technical setup (radiology, hospitalisation, surgery) and wheelchair access. Very well rated: 5/5 from 143 reviews. For emergencies outside its opening hours, the clinic itself refers patients to UVDelta 83 (Puget-sur-Argens) — a cross-confirmation that backs up UVDelta 83's role as already documented on this site.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>Open Monday to Friday from 8am to 12:30pm and then 2:30pm to 6:30pm, closed on weekends.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: save the clinic's number on your phone as soon as you arrive in Cavalaire — it can come in handy if something unexpected comes up.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
